        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "DefaultLowVolResolverPrompt",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const defaultExpensePrompt = `### Task Overview\n\nYour task is to taken in the input consisting of the user decomposed Instructions and resolve that field.\n\n### Your Input\nLowVolumeFieldsArray - LowVolumeFieldsArrayVar\n\n--- Steps to follow ---\n\n# Step 1 - Identify the messages that need to be resolved\nFor each element in array of 'LowVolumeFieldsArray' check\nif the 'type' == 'needsResolution'\nProcess only these elements\n\n# Step 2 - Field Identification and Resolution\n\nFor each element in 'LowVolumeFieldsArray' get the field and use following rules to resolve the respective fields\n1. To Resolve the 'flightClass' - \n  check if the 'value' includes any of the flight class from FlightClassLovVar\n  if Yes :\n  Structure the Output in following format - \n  Where \n  copy every other field as it is \n  change the 'type' to 'resolved'\n  and populate the 'value' with the id from FlightClassLovVar\n  {\n    \"message\": \"<sentence>\",\n    \"type\": \"resolved\",\n    \"field\": \"<field Name>\",\n    \"value\":\"<value>\",\n    \"reasoning\":<reasoning>\n  }\n  if No : (None of the Flight class matches with value)\n  Structure the Output in following format - \n  Where \n  copy every other field as it is \n  change the 'type' to 'unsupported'\n  {\n    \"message\": \"<sentence>\",\n    \"type\": \"unsupported\",\n    \"field\": \"<field Name>\",\n    \"value\":\"\",\n    \"reasoning\":<reasoning>\n  }\n\n2. To Resolve the 'flightType' -\n  check if the 'value' includes any of the flight type from FlightTypeVar\n  if Yes :\n  Structure the Output in following format - \n  Where \n  copy every other field as it is \n  change the 'type' to 'resolved'\n  and populate the 'value' with the id from the FlightTypeVar\n  {\n    \"message\": \"<sentence>\",\n    \"type\": \"resolved\",\n    \"field\": \"<field Name>\",\n    \"value\":\"<value>\",\n    \"reasoning\":<reasoning>\n  }\n  if No : (None of the Flight type matches with value)\n  Structure the Output in following format - \n  Where \n  copy every other field as it is \n  change the 'type' to 'unsupported'\n  {\n    \"message\": \"<sentence>\",\n    \"type\": \"unsupported\",\n    \"field\": \"<field Name>\",\n    \"value\":\"\",\n    \"reasoning\":<reasoning>\n  }\n\n\n3. To Resolve the 'receiptCurrency' -\n  Check if 'value' matches with the any of the available currency from GetAllReceiptCurrenciesVar\n  if Yes :\n  Structure the Output in following format - \n  Where \n  copy every other field as it is \n  change the 'type' to 'resolved'\n  and populate the 'value' with the $id of that respective currency from the list.\n  {\n    \"message\": \"<sentence>\",\n    \"type\": \"resolved\",\n    \"field\": \"<field Name>\",\n    \"value\":\"<value>\",\n    \"reasoning\":<reasoning>\n  }\n  if No : (None of the currency matches with value)\n  Structure the Output in following format - \n  Where \n  copy every other field as it is \n  change the 'type' to 'unsupported'\n  {\n    \"message\": \"<sentence>\",\n    \"type\": \"unsupported\",\n    \"field\": \"<field Name>\",\n    \"value\":\"\",\n    \"reasoning\":<reasoning>\n  }\n\n\n\n\n## Examples\nInput - \n{\n  \"LowVolumeFieldsArray\":[\n    {\n      \"message\":\"update flight class to first class\",\n      \"type\": \"needsResolution\",\n      \"field\":\"flightClass\",\n      \"value\":\"first class\",\n      \"reasoning\":\"The sentence directly updates the flightClass, flightClass  is a Low Volume expense field belonging to ExpenseAttributeActions and ORA_FIN_EXM_EXPENSE_AIRFARE_FIELD topic and need further resolution\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nOutput - \n{\n  \"ResolvedInstructions\":[\n    {\n      \"message\":\"update flight class to first class\",\n      \"type\": \"resolved\",\n      \"field\":\"flightClass\",\n      \"value\":\"EXM_TICKET_CLASS,FIRST\",\n      \"reasoning\":\"The sentence directly updates the flightClass, flightClass  is a Low Volume expense field belonging to ExpenseAttributeActions and ORA_FIN_EXM_EXPENSE_AIRFARE_FIELD topic and need further resolution\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n##ALways output with ResolvedInstructions key as per example. Dont omit it. \n`;\n\nconst out = $context.$nodes.GET_LOW_VOL_RESOLVER_PROMPT?.$output;\nconst prompts = Array.isArray(out?.prompts) ? out.prompts : [];\nlet expensePrompt = prompts?.find(p => p.promptType === \"MAIN\")?.prompt || defaultExpensePrompt;\n\nlet prompt = {\n  expensePrompt: expensePrompt,\n};\n\nreturn prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770112704848"
          },
          "code": "DEFAULTLOWVOLRESOLVERPROMPT",
